    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is18">
        <head xml:id="gom-is18-Hd1e98">Caput 18</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is18-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is18-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_1@1-2">Vae terrae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is18-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is18-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Quia de caeteris persecutoribus Ecclesiae dixerat</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quasi errando inutilia fecerit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_1@1-4">Vae terrae cymbalae alarum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e126"><seg type="qs">Convertitur iterum ad Aegyptum, et vocat eum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">timorem Domini abstulerunt eis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is18-Dd1e135">
          <head xml:id="gom-is18-Hd1e137">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e139">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e141" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_2@7-9">In vasis papyri,</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e144"><seg type="qs">id est in navibus de papyro factis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">pertransit et labitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_2@28-32">Gentem exspectantem et conculcatam.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e157"><seg type="qs">Omnes enim haeretici sibi promittunt ingentia</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">id est doctrinam eorum audiunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is18-Dd1e166">
          <head xml:id="gom-is18-Hd1e168">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e170">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1260A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e174" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_4@20-21">Nubes roris.</quote>
            Grata messoribus fatigatis, quibus refrigerium praestat, et stipulam arentem facit humectando secabilem: sic sermo meus contra Aegyptum, gratus omnibus erit in me credentibus, et Assyriis a me eis data victoria.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is18-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-is18-Hd1e181">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_5@12-12">Ramusculi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is18-Rd1e188"><name xml:id="gom-is18-Nd1e189" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e192">Inutiles: unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e194" source="http://scta.info/resource/io15_2@1-16">Ego sum vitis vera, et Pater meus agricola est: omnem palmitem in me non ferentem fructum tollet eum, et omnem qui fert fructum purgabit eum.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is18-Dd1e200">
          <head xml:id="gom-is18-Hd1e202">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e204">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e206" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_6@16-19">Et omnes bestiae terrae.</quote>
            Hyperbolicos. Neque enim omnes bestiae terrae super eum hyemabunt. Sed significat, et occisionem immensam, et bestiarum multitudinem maximam superventuram, quibus aestate et hieme cadavera sufficiant in escam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is18-Dd1e211">
          <head xml:id="gom-is18-Hd1e213">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is18-d1e215">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1260B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_7@1-2">In tempore.</quote>
            Revertitur Propheta ad populum Israel, et promittit ei bona, dicens: <quote xml:id="gom-is18-Qd1e222" source="http://scta.info/resource/is18_7@1-2">In tempore,</quote> quasi dicat: Vastata Aegypto, non sperabit ultra Juda in umbra ejus; sed fidei et bonorum operum Domino offerret munus. Quod impletum est septuagesimo anno post captivitatem sub Zorobabel et aliis ducibus.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
